# EarnLoop

Brand: **EarnLoop** — “Learn it. Ship it. Loop the earnings.”

Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/00-PLAN.md` before implementing.

- Stack: Next.js App Router, Tailwind, shadcn, TypeScript, Framer Motion, Supabase, Vercel Hobby.
- AI: Gemini + OpenAI with login credits. Validate hustle JSON with `contracts/side-hustle.schema.json`.
- Ads: AdSense in the web app. Store AdMob IDs only.
- Gamification XP only for completed work (steps, proofs), not page views or ad clicks.
- No `any`. No TODO placeholders. No Redis. No AdMob SDK in the browser.
- Navbar: Learn, Earn, Tools, Services, News, Pricing, Loop, Admin.
